<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cemig downgraded to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cemig downgraded to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Credit Lyonnais Securities said it downgraded state-owned power firm Companhia Energetica de Minas Gerais -- or Cemig -- to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- It said Cemig's third-quarter results of 46 million reais were below its forecast of 94 million reais.</p>
</text>
